{"unit_id":"crazy-L118__dsh-desktop-notify#card-zh","repo":"crazy-L118/dsh-desktop-notify","commit":"de3975207cdfe02b850d52c89bc2c86df3e0b8e8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-notify 是一个供 DSH Web 使用的桌面提醒插件：主对话完成一轮回复时发送系统原生通知，并可选择预览最新回复。它监听 agent 状态进入 idle，忽略子代理完成事件；通知可显示工作区和会话信息，并能在通用设置中控制开关、声音与预览。还可把完成消息推送到用户配置的多个设备地址。适合希望离开浏览器时仍能知道 DSH 回复已完成的用户。推送地址和可选令牌由用户配置；不配置推送时只需本机系统通知能力。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:531-545","lib/index.js:463-503","lib/client.js:398-430"]}
{"unit_id":"crazy-L118__dsh-desktop-notify#card-en","repo":"crazy-L118/dsh-desktop-notify","commit":"de3975207cdfe02b850d52c89bc2c86df3e0b8e8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-desktop-notify sends a native desktop alert when a main DSH conversation finishes. It ignores delegated subagents and can show a reply preview with workspace and session labels. A General settings panel controls alerts and optional HTTP pushes to multiple user-configured devices.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:531-545","lib/index.js:463-503","lib/client.js:398-430"]}
