{"unit_id":"crazy-L118__dsh-desktop-notify#feature-1","repo":"crazy-L118/dsh-desktop-notify","commit":"de3975207cdfe02b850d52c89bc2c86df3e0b8e8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-notify 的功能「桌面完成提醒」：主会话状态进入 idle 时发送系统桌面通知，子代理完成事件会被忽略；通知可包含回复预览及工作区、会话信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:531-545"]}
{"unit_id":"crazy-L118__dsh-desktop-notify#feature-2","repo":"crazy-L118/dsh-desktop-notify","commit":"de3975207cdfe02b850d52c89bc2c86df3e0b8e8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-desktop-notify 的功能「多设备 HTTP 推送」：可向设置中启用且填写地址的多个目标发送完成消息，内容含标题和回复正文；单个目标失败不会阻止其他目标。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:497-503"]}
